{"id":"n64346-1-7","stage":2,"title":"소금물 · 盐水","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64346-1-7-1","ko":"물에 소금을 너무 많이 넣었어.","zh":"水里加的盐太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물에","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"2","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소금을","meaning":"盐，咸盐","explanation":"소금：盐，咸盐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소금","audio":"/audio/3d09660e62955de5ce0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61167","senseId":"1","lemma":"소금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣었어.","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"湖、河、海等。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"3d09660e62955de5","term":"소금","zh":"盐，咸盐","audio":"/audio/3d09660e62955de5ce0d.mp3","entryId":"61167","definition":"有咸味的白色粉末。","pronunciation":["소금"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f89da0970447f4dc3c58.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64346-1-7-2","ko":"소금물의 농도가 높아졌겠는데.","zh":"盐水的浓度应该变高了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소금물의","meaning":"盐水","explanation":"소금물：盐水；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"소금물","audio":"/audio/9a3bad96e6a124fc820c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64346","senseId":"1","lemma":"소금물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"농도가","meaning":"浓度","explanation":"농도：浓度；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"농도","audio":"/audio/0ce17e0442bc231598ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43808","senseId":"1","lemma":"농도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"높아졌겠는데.","meaning":"高（这里指盐水浓度高）；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"높다：高（这里指盐水浓度高）；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"높다","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64523","senseId":"3","lemma":"높다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9a3bad96e6a124fc","term":"소금물","zh":"盐水","audio":"/audio/9a3bad96e6a124fc820c.mp3","entryId":"64346","definition":"溶入了盐的水。","pronunciation":["소금물"]},{"id":"0ce17e0442bc2315","term":"농도","zh":"浓度","audio":"/audio/0ce17e0442bc231598ba.mp3","entryId":"43808","definition":"某个成分在气体或液体中的浓稠程度。","pronunciation":["농도"]},{"id":"5601621a4a648d5b","term":"높다","zh":"高（这里指盐水浓度高）","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3","entryId":"64523","definition":"高（这里指盐水浓度高）","pronunciation":["놉따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a76c3d15fcbbb5e2ef6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.133,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64346","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["水里加的盐太多了。","盐水的浓度应该变高了。","最近看见你爸爸时不时叹气。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["水里加的盐太多了。","盐水的浓度应该变高了。","最近看见你爸爸时不时叹气。"],"answer":1}]}
